SplatWorksTM exception
----------------------

The SplatWorksTM app family is released under the GNU General Public License,
version 3.0 only (GPL-3.0-only). This currently includes GridSplatTM in
`splatworks/gridsplat/` and ShowSplatTM in `splatworks/showsplat/`. See
`splatworks/gridsplat/LICENSE.md` and `splatworks/gridsplat/COPYING` for the
GPL-3.0-only license text currently bundled with the SplatWorksTM apps.

This license split lets SplatWorksTM apps ship with GPL-3.0-only dependencies
while DrawSplatTM whiteboard and the existing tools/widgets continue under the
current AGPL-3.0-or-later licensing.

In plain language:

- Individual educators, students, and community users may use the open
  versions for free.
- You may study, copy, modify, and share the open versions under the license
  terms that apply to each subproject.
- If you modify DrawSplatTM and offer it as a hosted network service, AGPL
  requires you to make the corresponding source code available to users.
- Paid school, district, hosted, closed-source, embedded, or site-license
  deployments of AGPL-covered DrawSplatTM components may use a separate
  commercial license.

The full AGPL v3.0 license text is available at:

https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html

For commercial licensing, see COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md.

